WEBVTT

00:00:27.398 --> 00:00:30.943
Now its name may not
scream “tourist trap,”

00:00:30.943 --> 00:00:32.111
but believe me,

00:00:32.153 --> 00:00:36.657
it is a beautiful part of the world
and you should all try and visit sometime.

00:00:37.533 --> 00:00:40.620
But more importantly, it could play --

00:00:40.661 --> 00:00:43.706
It has the potential
to play a crucial role

00:00:43.748 --> 00:00:47.001
in the fight against global
climate catastrophe.

00:00:48.461 --> 00:00:52.048
The most recent IPCC reports are clear.

00:00:52.465 --> 00:00:55.968
Humanity has left
cutting emissions too late.

00:00:56.552 --> 00:01:01.891
Any realistic path to avoiding
unacceptable levels of warming